WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
A worker bends and reaches toward the surface of an unfinished pitched roof with a handheld tool. Timber framing, neighboring houses, trees and sky surround the roof.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.010
The worker raises their torso and stands more upright. This silent excerpt is shown at original speed.
